From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pulsar Seat <pulsar-seat@invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 08:05:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] pulsar: pulsar_idd capture backend

capture = pulsar_idd reads the seat's frame channel of the Pulsar Seat IddCx driver (Global\PulsarSplit.Display.<seat>.Header / FrameReady / Tex<gen>.<i> / Fence<gen>), opened by name on the render adapter named in the header, with hardware and software encoder variants, HDR metadata from the header, producer liveness and capture.error, and the client's mode asked from the service over the seat pipe (display.mode.request / display.mode.result). SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
---
 cmake/compile_definitions/windows.cmake     |   1 +
 src/platform/windows/display.h              | 115 +++++
 src/platform/windows/display_base.cpp       |  22 +
 src/platform/windows/display_pulsar_idd.cpp | 533 ++++++++++++++++++++
 src/platform/windows/display_vram.cpp       |  44 ++
 src/pulsar/control.cpp                      |  10 +
 src/pulsar/control.h                        |   2 +
 7 files changed, 727 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/platform/windows/display_pulsar_idd.cpp

